   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the vehicle and traffic law, in relation to exempting new electric vehicles, clean fuel vehicles and vehicles that meet the clean vehicle standards from the fees for the first year of registration of such vehicles; and providing for the repeal of such provisions upon expiration thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S2932",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S2932-2017",
